# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Blood Oath, Corpse Skin and Evil Omen in value order, one per pass.
#
# @ hotkeys Blood Oath, Corpse Skin, Evil Omen
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ config
#
#   config__symbols_blood_oath, config__symbols_corpse_skin, config__symbols_evil_omen
#      Unholy Symbols banked before each ability may fire: its own cost plus what the more
#      valuable abilities above it keep back. Symbols arrive one per five seconds and bank
#      to Effective Necromancy / 10. Blood Oath plus Corpse Skin spend six a thirty second
#      cycle, the sustainable rotation at Necromancy 100.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! config__symbols_blood_oath 4
@setvar! config__symbols_corpse_skin 4
@setvar! config__symbols_evil_omen 4


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ timer
#
#   timer__blood_oath, timer__corpse_skin, timer__evil_omen
#      Ready on the first pass.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
timer__blood_oath interval__necro_action
timer__corpse_skin interval__necro_action
timer__evil_omen interval__necro_action


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ loop
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # NECRO BURST
    #
    # Each ability goes out through its Razor hotkey, resolves without a cursor, and
    # answers with either "unholy symbols remaining" or the cooldown line, so success is
    # read rather than assumed. The combat three run as one chain in value order, one per
    # pass, so the bank is re-read between them and a lower one never spends what a higher
    # one was saving.
    #
    #   blood oath     +30% follower damage, 5 self damage. The followers are 63% of the
    #                  damage, so this outweighs everything else in this block
    #   corpse skin    every damaging spell adds a disease worth 25% over 30 seconds
    #   evil omen      +20% spell damage, and a 25% chance per spell of half its mana in
    #                  self damage. Below Corpse Skin: smaller bonus with a cost attached
    #
    # Of the rest, Strangle (4) competes with Blood Oath for symbols and delays every hit
    # by five seconds, Wither (5) buys mana only for spells that do no damage, and Pain
    # Spike (5) wants a corpse next to the next mob. None earn a place here.
    #
    # Corpse Skin and Evil Omen only pay off through the loop's own spells, and the loop
    # casts no damage spell while the player is walking or has taken over in warmode. So
    # both wait for a standing player in automatic mode: the first stop after a move opens
    # them together with the procs instead of burning their duration on the walk. Blood
    # Oath feeds the followers, who fight on either way, so it takes neither guard, and
    # the two guards sit on the Corpse Skin and Evil Omen lines instead of on the block.
    # necro/vampiric-embrace has no walk guard either: it is walk only, so one would have
    # parked it for good.
    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Set when an ability lands. necro/poison-strike sits out any pass that spent, since the
    # list is only rebuilt on the next pass.
    @setvar! var__symbols_spent 0

    if list 'list__necro_symbols' >= config__symbols_blood_oath and followers > 0 and timer "timer__blood_oath" >= interval__necro_action and not targetexists and not casting
        hotkey 'Blood Oath'
        wait wait__message

        if insysmsg "unholy symbols remaining"
            settimer "timer__blood_oath" 0
            @setvar! var__symbols_spent 1

            if config__chatty = 1
                overhead "[ blood oath ]" 219
            endif
        elseif insysmsg "seconds before you may use that ability again."
            settimer "timer__blood_oath" 0
        endif
    elseif list 'list__necro_symbols' >= config__symbols_corpse_skin and not warmode and timer "timer__corpse_skin" >= interval__necro_action and cooldown "walk" = 0 and not targetexists and not casting
        hotkey 'Corpse Skin'
        wait wait__message

        if insysmsg "unholy symbols remaining"
            settimer "timer__corpse_skin" 0
            @setvar! var__symbols_spent 1

            if config__chatty = 1
                overhead "[ corpse skin ]" 219
            endif
        elseif insysmsg "seconds before you may use that ability again."
            settimer "timer__corpse_skin" 0
        endif
    elseif list 'list__necro_symbols' >= config__symbols_evil_omen and not warmode and timer "timer__evil_omen" >= interval__necro_action and cooldown "walk" = 0 and not targetexists and not casting
        hotkey 'Evil Omen'
        wait wait__message

        if insysmsg "unholy symbols remaining"
            settimer "timer__evil_omen" 0
            @setvar! var__symbols_spent 1

            if config__chatty = 1
                overhead "[ evil omen ]" 219
            endif
        elseif insysmsg "seconds before you may use that ability again."
            settimer "timer__evil_omen" 0
        endif
    endif
